__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Run logs and flight recordings are per-session artefacts.
# 執行日誌與飛行紀錄是單次實驗產物。
logs/*.log
logs/*.csv
logs/*.png

# YOLO weights. Kept out of version control for size, but they must exist in
# models/ before going offline on the Tello router - see the README.
# YOLO 權重因體積不進版本控制，但連上沒有對外網路的 Tello 路由器之前，models/ 裡必須已有檔案——見 README。
*.pt
